ared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/5abf4fc3eb51d3c52bd3c1cafa3a3d11.mp4?t=1750223030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 1 is about 3-4 hours of content on the main quest with an extra hour or so of sidequests and hidden content. New chapters will be released as DLC.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore MP by slapping your teammates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discuss mortality with a meat golem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal sandwiches from a child's lunchbox</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the protagonists slowly lose hope as they get lost in an increasingly strange &amp; hopeless environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in banter to lighten the mood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome the terrors and escape (maybe)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One of the main mechanics of Chapter 1 is managing limited heals and saves. There are enough oppourtunities to do both to get you to the end of the chapter, but some players may find this challenging.</i></p></li></ul>",
